  "recommended_approach": "Enable --disable-pool-balance-checks only on owned trace-profile Anvil. Preserve raw signed FIFO order and existing fixed header; defer parent-state admission to actual ordered block execution. Keep EVM validity, memory/input/prefix/Docker/guardian/total-deadline controls unchanged.",
