      "fact": "Builder controls backend disable_pool_balance_checks only; default false at653."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry/blob/cae51ad458f6abb64852b7709eb784352429825d/crates/anvil/src/eth/api.rs#L2982-L2985",
      "fact": "Raw signed submission recovers PendingTransaction and invokes parent-state pool validation."
