      "fact": "Flag skips pool balance AND gas/fee checks; this is broader than balance-only admission."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry/blob/cae51ad458f6abb64852b7709eb784352429825d/crates/anvil/src/eth/backend/mem/mod.rs#L5475-L5491",
